# T085: "Not now" on the repair page leaves browse-only: the list is there, nothing can be installed, updated or removed, and nothing is changed.
# scenario repair
# expect-unchanged
size 1404 1872
wait 400
waitfor repairText
tap notNow
waitfor appRow
expect notice repaired first
shot @OUT@/12-browse-only.png
tap appRow 1
waitfor detailState
expect_absent actionUpdate
expect_absent actionRemove
expect_absent actionInstall
tap back
quit
